{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/cca1ad7db39f02f1b8ab1596f390eb4a.poster.avif?t=1758838866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/cca1ad7db39f02f1b8ab1596f390eb4a.webm?t=1758838866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/96fc23422be6ca1f85f302546d16f30e.avif?t=1758838866\" width=856 height=107 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Take your orders and design unique collections. Use different fabrics from cotton to linen to create unique collections with thousands of combinations. Every corner of your workshop, from the smallest scissors to the largest shelf, is the reflection of your art.</strong> <br><strong> </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/429de22ca8892130abe68ec8224ee7f0.poster.avif?t=1758838866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/429de22ca8892130abe68ec8224ee7f0.webm?t=1758838866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/cd368020ea1575e500e03e512e286d34.avif?t=1758838866\" width=856 height=107 /></span><br>\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Begin your journey in an old, abandoned workshop and turn it into your dream tailor workshop. Buy new furniture, tear down walls and deliver best tailoring experience to your customers. Every decision you make will affect your production capacity and\u00a0visual\u00a0appeal.</strong> <br> <br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/e4b6008d19c3e4e1fae043cef889e193.poster.avif?t=1758838866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/e4b6008d19c3e4e1fae043cef889e193.webm?t=1758838866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/33358f68c6d3567a8fff637e86606680.avif?t=1758838866\" width=856 height=107 /></span><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Manage your inventory perfectly. Hire staff, build shelves, and organize your deliveries to meet\u00a0the\u00a0deadlines. How you manage your production process will affect\u00a0your\u00a0revenue\u00a0and\u00a0reputation. </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/54d76c03594dec866d91c45ba1d8204b.poster.avif?t=1758838866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/54d76c03594dec866d91c45ba1d8204b.webm?t=1758838866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895490/extras/833b61e1f3aeb46f46748be42c33c918.avif?t=1758838866\" width=856 height=107 /></span><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Emporium District is the most vibrant area of France. Explore the district, make new friends, and enjoy exciting experiences. You will have a unique opportu